# Wave W17-N (Route 111): dune track — the desert track: worn pale sand over stone, the stone showing grey through the tread where a thousand crossings have ground the sand thin (design-authorised: a clear connected path of pale sand running end to end, Lilac to the ash road). Route 111’s own road — drier and more stone-worn than Route 110’s kept walking sand.
